21ay|n|A female who has the same parents with another person, or who has one of them only. In the latter case, she is more definitely called a half sister. The correlative of brother. ; A woman who is closely allied to, or assocciated with, another person, as in the sdame faith, society, order, or community. ; One of the same kind, or of the same condition; -- generally used adjectively; as, sister fruits.	a:1abn,35,7~1abn,35,7	V:21ba,31,1;yaw,18,3~yaw,18,3;21ba,31,1	N:21b8,71,53;21ba,59,7;1z4m,50,5;17gz,18,2~21b8,71,53;21ba,59,7;1z4m,50,5;17gz,18,2
